<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36358" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντῠπ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carve</i> or <i>mould in</i> or <i>upon,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ νομίσματι ἐνετύπωσεν ἀπήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					568
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ νομίσματα ξιφίδια δύο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					47.25
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαλμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					5.8.6
				</span></i>
			; also of a painter, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.282
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>): metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα τῇ ψυχῇ ἐντετύπωκεν ὁ θεός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.106
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φειδίαν ἐν μέσῃ τῇ ἀσπίδι τὸ
					ἑαυτοῦ πρόσωπον ἐντυπώσασθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					399b35
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, Aristeas<i><span class="en">
				67
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τύλοι ἐντετυπωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.43
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be imprinted,</i> of a birth-mark, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.81c
			</span></i>; also, <i>to be flattened</i> by pressure, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				4.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				38
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντετύπωται ταῖς θύραις</span>
			<i>is like a piece of carving on</i> the doors, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				8.7.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἰδίωμα τῇ λέξει ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Longin.
					10.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
